{"@context":"http://iiif.io/api/presentation/3/context.json","id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/manifests/herbert-huncke-at-ultimatum-festival-1985-05-05.json","type":"Manifest","label":{"en":["Herbert Huncke at Ultimatum Festival 1985-05-05"]},"homepage":[{"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985","type":"Text","label":{"en":["Herbert Huncke at Ultimatum Festival 1985-05-05"]},"format":"text/html"}],"metadata":[{"label":{"en":["Description"]},"value":{"en":["The following is a transcription of the Herbert Huncke set at Ultimatum, Sunday, May 5th, 1985 at the Foufounes Electriques. Huncke was an American writer and poet and member of the Beat Generation, a term which he is considered to have coined. He is the author of the book The Evening Sun Turned Crimson from which he reads three stories in his Ultimatum set: \"Cuba\", \"Alvarez\", and \"Russian Blackie\"."]}},{"label":{"en":["Language"]},"value":{"en":["English"]}}],"items":[{"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7","type":"Canvas","duration":2495,"annotations":[{"@context":"http://iiif.io/api/presentation/3/context.json","id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/manifests/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05-canvas7-1","type":"AnnotationPage","label":{"en":["Alan Lord Commentary"]},"items":[{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Last on the festival bill—and closing off the proceedings—was beloved Beat Generation legend Herbert Huncke, reading from his book The Evening Sun Turned Crimson. I introduced Huncke, and he led off by saying: “I really want to start off with one particular story here, because I feel that it will fit into the general theme of the festival … a group of creative people, young people trying to do things, it’s very very encouraging for an old man like me… I want to think that things have progressed a little …”","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Event Description","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=0,0"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"On April 20th 1989, I invited Herbert Huncke to read at my “Tribute To William Burroughs” soirée at the Foufounes Électriques. His old friend Bill was there, and the two were left together to catch up with each other in a VIP room set up for them. You can read about that special moment - and much more - in my book High Friends In Low Places published by Guernica.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Personal Anecdote","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"External Resource","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=143,143"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"The last time I saw my beloved Huncke was at a party he brought me to at New York’s Chelsea Hotel, in November of 1990.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Personal Anecdote","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=283,283"}]},{"@context":"http://iiif.io/api/presentation/3/context.json","id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/manifests/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05-canvas7-1","type":"AnnotationPage","label":{"en":["Audio Description"]},"items":[{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Applause.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Audience","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=0,6"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"J’espere, j’espere un jour que on peut dire 'Herbert Huncke' puis on l’appreciera pleinement son avoir a faire des deferences a la Beat Generation, Kerouac, Ginsberg, Burroughs, tous ca. Maintenant je la fait une derniere fois, la prochaine fois c’est Herbert Huncke, tout seul.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Alan Lord","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=6,24"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Alright!","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Audience Member","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=24,25"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Applause and cheers.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Audience","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=25,28"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"[Off mic] Okay, well let me just say first before we start, all, what has happened this evening [unintelligible] a hard act to follow [unintelligible].","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Herbert Huncke","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=28,38"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"You have to talk into the mic.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Unknown Speaker","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=59,60"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"I will in just a minute. Some people can hear me though.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Herbert Huncke","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=60,64"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Room noise.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Foufounes Electriques","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=64,66"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Are you satisfied now? Okay. I really wanna start off with one particular story here because I feel that it will fit into the general theme of the so-called gathering or festival whatever, group of creative people doing things, trying to do things, young people. It’s very very encouraging for an old man like me, you know I want to think that things have progressed [laughs] a little. Boy.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Herbert Huncke","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=66,115"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Laughter.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Audience","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=115,117"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Well, here, I wasn’t gonna read this one, but I will. I’ll start anyway so everything is under control. It’s called \"Cuba\". It’s a rather strange story in that the individual involved was someone I met and felt somewhat sorry for if I may be permitted to feel sorry about anybody.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Herbert Huncke","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=117,139"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Reads \"Cuba\" from The Evening Sun Turned Crimson [brief moments of laughter throughout].","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Herbert Huncke","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=139,575"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Applause.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Audience","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=575,579"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Sorry, it’s not the one I want, oh I can’t do it now [unintelligible].","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Herbert Huncke","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=579,583"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Applause.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Audience","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=583,586"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"[Off mice] Thank you. [On mic] Let me see if I can find the one I intended to start out with. \"Alvarez\". One, let’s see, one fifty one, okay, we’ll get there, hell or high water [laughs], ah, there [laughs]. This is a, I feel it’s a very, very sad story mysel - woops. \"Alvarez\".","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Herbert Huncke","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=586,614"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Reads \"Alvarez\" from The Evening Sun Turned Crimson.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Herbert Huncke","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=614,649"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Cuts out, light static.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Recording","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=649,651"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Silence.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Recording","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=651,652"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Continues reading.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Herbert Huncke","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=652,1494"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Applause.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Audience","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7#t=1494,1495"},{"@context":"http://www.w3.org/ns/anno.jsonld","type":"Annotation","motivation":["commenting","tagging"],"id":"https://spokenweb.github.io/Ultimatumi1985/herbert_huncke_at_ultimatum_festival_1985_05_05/canvas/7/page1","body":[{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Okay.","format":"text/plain","motivation":"commenting"},{"type":"TextualBody","value":"Herbert Huncke","format":"text/plain","purpose":"tagging","motivation":"tagging"}],"target":"https://s